WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:03.210
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:09.300
Today I am going to explain the science fiction
drama film called “Mr. Nobody.”

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.670
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:15.650
Watch out and take care!

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.690
The movie is set in the year 2092.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:23.760
Humanity has conquered mortality through the
endless renewal of cells.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:29.789
An 118-year-old man named Nemo is the last
mortal left on earth.

00:00:29.789 --> 00:00:35.539
Everyone else on earth is quasi-immortal and
no longer suffers from illnesses and aging.

00:00:35.539 --> 00:00:40.850
This has come at a cost and these quasi-immortal
humans can no longer procreate.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:46.359
Although he is evidently older, Nemo insists
that he is 35 years old and was born in the

00:00:46.359 --> 00:00:48.109
year 1975.

00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:53.489
Scientists, researching life before humans
attained immortality, believe that Nemo has

00:00:53.489 --> 00:00:54.910
lost his memory.

00:00:54.910 --> 00:01:00.299
With no recollection and written records of
his past anywhere, people start calling Nemo

00:01:00.299 --> 00:01:01.739
Mr. Nobody.

00:01:01.739 --> 00:01:07.600
He spends his life under 24/7 surveillance
and people vote every week to decide whether

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:12.219
he should be allowed to naturally pass away
or artificially kept alive.

00:01:12.219 --> 00:01:18.070
Curious to know Nemo’s past, a psychiatrist
named Dr. Feldheim uses hypnosis to help him

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:20.020
recall some of his memories.

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:25.869
The hypnosis helps Nemo access his subconsciousness
reaching as far back as the time even before

00:01:25.869 --> 00:01:27.000
his conception.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:32.540
While Dr. Feldheim is away, a journalist sneaks
into the facility where Nemo is kept and takes

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:33.649
his interview.

00:01:33.649 --> 00:01:39.189
Nemo reveals to the journalist that all unborn
babies reside in heaven and remember everything

00:01:39.189 --> 00:01:44.090
that can happen in their future and how it
can be altered if they make certain choices.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:49.180
However, before they are born, the angels
of Oblivion erase their memory.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:54.960
Somehow, the Angels forget about Nemo, allowing
him to "remember" different possible futures

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.369
for himself.

00:01:56.369 --> 00:02:01.929
This means that the present day 118-year-old
forgetful Nemo can recall his different probable

00:02:01.929 --> 00:02:06.740
pasts and among one of them is the actual
life he led.

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:11.090
Nemo further reveals that the babies get to
choose their parents and he chose his mother

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:12.700
because she smelled nice.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:17.250
Nemo took birth with the ability to foresee
all possible futures.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:23.390
At age 9, he tells his mother about the Angels
of oblivion.

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:28.080
He correctly predicts that his father’s
car will get out of control and kill a lady.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:32.480
However, Nemo’s mother doesn’t believe
him and tells him that one can only see the

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:33.750
past, not the future.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.800
Nemo’s mother is justified to think so.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:42.770
Some 13.7 billion years ago, our universe,
which was then smaller than a proton, exploded

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:45.480
and started rapidly expanding.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:50.190
After the big bang, three spatial and one
temporal dimensions were deployed.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:54.110
While the spatial dimension allowed us to
freely travel within what we know as width,

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:58.310
height and depth, the temporal dimension doesn’t
offer that same freedom.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:03.600
The arrow of time as we know it only moves
in one direction and it’s most evident proof

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:07.030
is that we can only see our past and not see
our future.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:11.860
So, if Nemo is able to see the future that
would mean that time can be reversed, which

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:12.860
we haven’t witnessed yet.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:13.860
At the park, Nemo acquaints three girls from
his neighbourhood Anna, Elise and Jean.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.730
One day, Nemo notices his mother walking into
the woods by herself.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.730
He follows her and sees her cheating on his
father with another man.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:26.520
The infidelity eventually comes to light and
Nemo’s parents have a huge fight which ends

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:27.520
in devorce.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:31.970
They go their separate ways and poor Nemo
is forced to choose one of his parents as

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:36.250
his mother leaves on a train while his father
stays on the platform.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:40.960
In one instance, Nemo decides to board the
train with his mother and move to Canada while

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.360
in another he stays with his father.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.750
In the instance where he leaves with his mother,
Nemo becomes a rebellious teenager.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.440
He tries his best to scare her mother’s
boyfriend Harry away.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:55.340
Meanwhile, Nemo’s dad meets with an accident
and becomes disabled.

00:03:55.340 --> 00:04:00.360
At school, Nemo notices a new girl Anna and
is instantly smitten by her.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:04.060
One day, Anna approaches him on the beach
and asks him if he would like to swim with

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.130
her and her friends.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:09.770
However, Nemo rudely declines her, telling
her he doesn’t swim with idiots.

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:13.260
Offended, Anna leaves and they barely see
each other again.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:19.080
Two decades pass by and Nemo one day runs
into Anna with her two kids at the train station.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:23.660
They awkwardly greet each other before parting
ways and Nemo regrets insulting Anna at the

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.430
beach when he was young.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:29.530
Nemo again revisits his choice at the beach
and when Anna approaches Nemo at the beach,

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:32.120
he truthfully admits to her that he cannot
swim.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.660
The two then spend time together.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:35.690
Few days pass by.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:39.040
Nemo isn’t able to fend off his mother’s
boyfriend.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.710
Harry moves in with him and his mother with
his daughter.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:47.050
It turns out that Anna is Harry’s daughter,
making Nemo her step brother.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:52.230
Nemo and Anna have mutual disgust for their
parents' relationship and overtime get romantically

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:53.640
close to each other.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:57.590
Nemo starts sneaking into Anna’s room at
night behind his mother’s back.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:05:02.340
Eventually, Nemo’s mother and Harry find
out about the step-siblings' affair and decide

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.350
to separate to break them up.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:06.920
Nemo and Anna are heartbroken by the news.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:11.410
Anna makes Nemo promise to wait for her at
the lighthouse every Sunday until they see

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:12.770
each other again.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.910
Anna moves to New York with her father.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:19.830
Nemo waits for Anna at the lighthouse for
months but never meets her while Anna sends

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:24.950
him letters but Nemo’s mother hides them
from Nemo and eventually they both lose touch.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:28.090
Nemo becomes more and more distant from his
mother.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.220
Two decades pass by.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.350
Nemo still dearly remembers Anna.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:38.710
He works as a pool cleaner, hoping to one
day run into Anna who loves swimming.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:45.260
Eventually, they finally see one another at
the train station and immediately recognize

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.680
each other in a crowd of passers-by.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.880
The two embrace each other and passionately
make up for the time they lost.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:56.240
Anna tells him while she was kept away from
him, she had vowed that she would never love

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:58.250
anyone else ever.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.480
She never became attached to anyone.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:02.320
She had nothing for herself.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.980
She only pretended to be alive.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:07.930
This moment is what she has been waiting for
all this time.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.340
She renounced all possible lives and loves
for him.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:15.320
However, she adds that she is not used to
love anymore.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:19.090
She is terrified of losing him again and go
through the hell she went through when they

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:20.919
were separated at 15.

00:06:20.919 --> 00:06:23.510
She tells him that she needs more time.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:28.250
Anna gives him her number, asks him to call
her in two days and meet at the lighthouse.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:33.020
However, he loses her number when a sudden
downpour makes her note illegible.

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:36.920
Nemo waits at the lighthouse every day, but
Anna does not come.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:40.750
In a different storyline, Anna and Nemo get
married and have children.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:45.300
He works as a host of a TV show, which explains
various scientific phenomena.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:50.480
One evening, while driving home from work,
Nemo hits a bird and loses control of his

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.480
car.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.960
The out of control car plummets into a lake
and Nemo drowns.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:54.960
Meanwhile, in a similar yet alternate version
of events, Nemo works at the same television

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:55.960
studio but isn’t married to Anna.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:56.960
Moreover, Nemo’s assistant crashes into
the lake and drowns instead of him.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:57.960
At the funeral, Nemo meets Anna who is revealed
to be his assistant's widow.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:00.550
With none of these life paths ending happily,
Nemo explores the life he would have led had

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:02.680
he chosen to stay with his father.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:07.190
In this instance as well, Nemo’s father
meets with an accident and becomes disabled.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:12.400
Nemo starts working at a local shop when he
is not in school or taking care of his father.

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:16.670
In his leisure time, he likes riding bikes
and writing science fiction stories about

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.510
a journey to Mars at home on his typewriter.

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:24.350
At a school party, Nemo meets a girl named
Elise and develops feelings for her.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.410
However, he freezes in front of her.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:30.990
When Elise encourages him to say something,
the nerd starts talking about Mars.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:35.850
Elise laughs at his nerdiness and makes him
swear that when she dies, he will spread her

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.740
ashes on mars.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:42.919
Some days later, he goes to Elise’s house
to ask her out but he sees her with her ex-boyfriend

00:07:42.919 --> 00:07:43.919
Stefano.

00:07:43.919 --> 00:07:48.420
Frustrated, he speeds away on his motorcycle
and meets with an accident that sends him

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.930
into a vegetative state.

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:55.090
Though he can perceive the world through his
senses, Nemo cannot move or speak.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.949
He senses his parents' reunion at his bedside.

00:07:57.949 --> 00:08:02.410
Nemo tries to remember the movement of his
fingers on the typewriter keyboard and eventually

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:06.930
manages to lift a finger as this story line
comes to a close.

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:11.150
Nemo again reverses back to the time when
he saw Elise with Stefano.

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:16.510
This time after Stefano leaves, Nemo approaches
Elise and professes his love for her.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:21.120
Elise breaks into tears and confesses that
she is in love with Stefano but he doesn’t

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.449
love her back.

00:08:22.449 --> 00:08:25.340
Elise then politely rejects him and leaves.

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:29.360
Once again heartbroken, Nemo vows to marry
the first girl who will dance with him at

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.060
the school prom.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.979
That night, he meets a cute girl named Jean
and dances with her.

00:08:34.979 --> 00:08:38.389
While returning home with her, Nemo takes
several pledges.

00:08:38.389 --> 00:08:42.110
He vows to marry Jean and become rich and
successful.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:43.200
Years pass by.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:48.600
Nemo has a beautiful wife, two children and
a big house but he is still unhappy with his

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:49.600
life.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:53.809
After feeling discontent with his destination
despite having planned his life, Nemo starts

00:08:53.809 --> 00:08:57.430
making all of his decisions randomly via coin
toss.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:01.329
He writes over all his possessions to Jean
and leaves his family.

00:09:01.329 --> 00:09:05.850
At the airport, the coin leads him to pretend
to be a passenger named Daniel Jones, who

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.279
is taken to a hotel by a waiting chauffeur.

00:09:08.279 --> 00:09:13.730
In Daniel’s hotel room, Nemo is murdered
by two assassins who mistake him for Daniel

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:14.730
Jones.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:18.080
Nemo again revists the time when he was at
Elise’s house.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:22.540
Nemo learns that Elise is in love with her
ex-boyfriend but he does not back down and

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.899
convinces her to give him a chance.

00:09:24.899 --> 00:09:27.360
Few years pass by and the two get married.

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:32.380
In one version of the storyline, Elise dies
in a blast shortly after they get married.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:37.130
Fulfilling his promise, Nemo keeps her ashes
and embarks on a journey to Mars.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:41.089
While returning back to earth after spreading
Elise’s ashes on the planet’s surface,

00:09:41.089 --> 00:09:43.540
Nemo meets Anna aboard the spacecraft.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:48.730
However, before they can say much to each
other, the ship is destroyed by meteoroids.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:53.110
In an alternate version of events, Nemo and
Elise are married with three children.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:58.980
However, Elise is suffering from several borderline
personality disorder and chronic depression.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:03.269
She frequently experiences panic attacks and
despite Nemo’s several attempts to save

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:07.379
their marriage, Elise ultimately leaves him
to pursue Stefano.

00:10:07.379 --> 00:10:11.980
While running through all the paths he could
take or has taken, Nemo time and again wakes

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:16.379
up in a surrealistic world that seems like
a movie set, possibly indicating that it is

00:10:16.379 --> 00:10:18.899
not a possible path of Nemo’s life.

00:10:18.899 --> 00:10:23.279
Nemo follows several clues he finds scattered
throughout the city and ultimately reaches

00:10:23.279 --> 00:10:26.369
a crumbling, abandoned wooden-framed house.

00:10:26.369 --> 00:10:30.189
Inside, he finds a DVD player hooked up to
a television screen.

00:10:30.189 --> 00:10:36.410
In the oddly interactive video, the 118-year-old
Nemo converses with the 34-year-old one.

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:41.189
The older Nemo explains that the life the
younger Nemo is living is the older Nemo’s

00:10:41.189 --> 00:10:43.860
past and therefore time is inverted for him.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:48.519
The older Nemo further reveals that the younger
Nemo doesn’t exist in this particular universe

00:10:48.519 --> 00:10:53.339
because in this universe Nemo Nobody was never
born and it is all the possible life paths

00:10:53.339 --> 00:11:01.249
being played in the mind of the unborn baby
Nemo’s consciousness in heaven.

00:11:01.249 --> 00:11:05.700
The older Nemo states that he is experiencing
the story from the end and that he must stay

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:11.230
alive until 5:50 AM on 12 February 2092.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:15.649
After hearing all of the possible storylines,
the journalist becomes confused as to which

00:11:15.649 --> 00:11:19.829
story is the actual past of the 118 year old
Nemo.

00:11:19.829 --> 00:11:22.910
Nemo tells him that each one of these are
the right ones.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.019
Each path is the right path.

00:11:25.019 --> 00:11:30.730
The response puzzles the journalist even more
and he asks Nemo how he can exist after dying.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.050
He wonders if there’s something called afterlife.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:37.559
Nemo laughs him off and asks him how he can
be sure if he even exists.

00:11:37.559 --> 00:11:41.329
Nemo then goes on to tell him that neither
of them exist.

00:11:41.329 --> 00:11:46.639
They are figments in the mind of the 9-year-old
Nemo at the train station, as he was forced

00:11:46.639 --> 00:11:48.660
to make an impossible choice.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:53.639
In order to find the correct decision, the
young boy follows each choice to its conclusion.

00:11:53.639 --> 00:11:58.319
However, after going through all of his options,
it has become even more difficult for young

00:11:58.319 --> 00:12:00.170
Nemo to make his decision.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:05.829
Nemo ultimately decides to take the third
option: to not make the choice at all.

00:12:05.829 --> 00:12:10.290
He leaves both parents and runs away towards
an unknown future.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:14.220
Sometimes in chess the only viable move is
not to move.

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:19.829
All the instances that were playing in Nemo’s
head begin to crumble as he has made his decision

00:12:19.829 --> 00:12:20.829
clear.

00:12:20.829 --> 00:12:23.980
The movie cuts back to the old Nemo on his
deathbed.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:29.629
Just before he passes away, Nemo recalls his
reunion with Anna and recites Anna’s name.

00:12:29.629 --> 00:12:34.730
It is revealed that Anna ultimately came to
the lighthouse and reunited with Nemo.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:39.190
This version of Nemo’s life and all events
that lead to it were the real ones.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:43.420
Now, the question remains, how was Nemo able
to see the future?

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:48.889
Lo and behold, at 5:50 AM, the expansion of
the universe comes to a halt and it begins

00:12:48.889 --> 00:12:52.290
to contract, resulting in reversal of time.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.589
The Universe is undergoing a Big crunch.

00:12:55.589 --> 00:12:59.980
After expanding for billions of years from
a small point of singularity to billions of

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:04.920
light-years in diameter, the gravitational
forces have finally counterbalanced the forces

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:08.199
of expansion i.e., the dark energy.

00:13:08.199 --> 00:13:12.649
Just like the temporal dimension was opened
after the big bang, it is now being closed

00:13:12.649 --> 00:13:15.100
during the retraction of the universe.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.459
Time is reverting.

00:13:16.459 --> 00:13:21.269
Consequently, Nemo is able to return to his
childhood, watch his parents get back together

00:13:21.269 --> 00:13:22.850
and be with Anna.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:28.290
The 118-year-old man cackles triumphantly
as he springs back into awareness with the

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:37.480
realization that his younger self has finally
found his one true love and life.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:42.430
Make sure to subscribe and turn on the notifications
so you can watch more videos like this.

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:43.230
Thanks for watching.

